00:00:08.809 --> 00:00:12.246 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Très élevée au départ,

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:13.513 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la surmortalité

00:00:11.278 --> 00:00:14.782 size:53% position:73% line:53%
