00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:25.592 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- De mars 2020 à mars 2022,

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:27.127 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le taux de surmortalité

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:28.629 size:53% position:73% line:53%
